      271        for-object AT ROW 3.33 COL 29.8 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL
      272        tt-c-wth-doc.bef-sum AT ROW 4.7 COL 11.6 COLON-ALIGNED
      273             LABEL "Сумма план"
